graph LR
    ModelRegistry[Model Registry<br/>Platform]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    ModelRegistry -->|controller watch| KServe[KServe<br/>InferenceService]

    %% Kubernetes API Dependencies
    ModelRegistry -->|SAR AuthZ<br/>6443/TCP| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API<br/>HTTPS/WSS]

    %% Kubernetes Resources Used
    subgraph "Kubernetes Resources"
        ConfigMap[ConfigMap<br/>create, update]
        Secret[Secret<br/>create]
        Service[Service<br/>get, list]
        Job[batch/v1 Job<br/>create]
        Namespace[Namespace<br/>list]
        SAR[SubjectAccessReview<br/>create]
        SSAR[SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>create]
        SSRR[SelfSubjectRulesReview<br/>create]
        CRB[ClusterRoleBinding<br/>list]
    end

    ModelRegistry -->|CRUD| ConfigMap
    ModelRegistry -->|CRUD| Secret
    ModelRegistry -->|read| Service
    ModelRegistry -->|create| Job
    ModelRegistry -->|AuthZ| SAR
    ModelRegistry -->|AuthZ| SSAR

    %% External Services
    ModelRegistry -->|model artifacts<br/>443/TCP HTTPS| S3[S3-compatible<br/>Storage]
    ModelRegistry -->|push/pull<br/>443/TCP HTTPS| OCI[OCI Registry]

    %% Key Frameworks
    ModelRegistry -->|operator framework| ControllerRuntime[controller-runtime<br/>0.24.1]
    ModelRegistry -->|HTTP routing| Chi[go-chi/chi<br/>v5.3.1]
    ModelRegistry -->|ORM| GORM[GORM<br/>v1.31.2]

    %% Internal Data Store
    ModelRegistry -->|catalog data<br/>5432/TCP| PostgreSQL[PostgreSQL<br/>17.6]

    %% Integration Points (inbound)
    Dashboard[ODH Dashboard] -.->|UI integration| ModelRegistry
    Pipelines[Data Science<br/>Pipelines] -.->|model lookup| ModelRegistry

    style ModelRegistry fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px,color:#fff
    style KServe fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style K8sAPI fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style S3 fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style OCI fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style PostgreSQL fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style ControllerRuntime fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Chi fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style GORM fill:#999,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Dashboard fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Pipelines fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ConfigMap fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style Secret fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style Service fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style Job fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style Namespace fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style SAR fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style SSAR fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style SSRR fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
    style CRB fill:#ddd,stroke:#333
